{
    "text": " If you haven't already noticed, I mostly enjoy spending my time coming up with and implementing new game mechanics. But at this point even I must admit that this world is not very good looking. Because I'm not making any changes to the visuals or the audio, it feels like the game doesn't really have any personality. And it's very easy for me to overlook the importance of aesthetics in any game that I'm working on. But I want to start to pay a little bit more attention to that. So here you can see my pity first attempt at doing that by changing to a custom background color.",
